{"steam_appid":1266470,"steam_name":"Real VR Fishing","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1266470/318109491/389ec2c4c12c9ace40c17744389587cb94d34b09/1772529665/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772530602","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257297122/ff1938a05e76f504662c0a61fda151e8ae4ea58a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772530602","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/ss_59877088eee45e11e82b463137c95393b82755ff.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782275649","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/b2b227b775330b2f070cf2f635efc0ce8a8e1148/ss_b2b227b775330b2f070cf2f635efc0ce8a8e1148.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782275649","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/63b462b2fdc047627babef7ae7aa4e8a9fdae8ad/ss_63b462b2fdc047627babef7ae7aa4e8a9fdae8ad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782275649","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/fc4b99de4e75bcf8d9828bf4fd76e8d72f36503a/ss_fc4b99de4e75bcf8d9828bf4fd76e8d72f36503a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782275649","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/abdf7f4541975ed5a182c9a63cd82865b310dbb7/ss_abdf7f4541975ed5a182c9a63cd82865b310dbb7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782275649"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Most Relaxing Fishing Trip in VR — Real VR Fishing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line across meticulously recreated real-world landscapes. 40 maps and 150+ species in the base game expand to 100+ fishing spots and 300+ species with DLC. Whether you're a first-timer or a seasoned angler, enjoy at your own pace in a calm, unhurried world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/fd964218692fc59ffe2ab831bbc0e8af.poster.avif?t=1782275649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/fd964218692fc59ffe2ab831bbc0e8af.webm?t=1782275649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/fd964218692fc59ffe2ab831bbc0e8af.mp4?t=1782275649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast, Wait, Feel the Bite</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From casting to reeling, every action delivers lifelike resistance. Keep it easy in Normal Mode, or test your skills in Expert Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/11524a260d95086e525411ff9bc55332.poster.avif?t=1782275649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/11524a260d95086e525411ff9bc55332.webm?t=1782275649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/11524a260d95086e525411ff9bc55332.mp4?t=1782275649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo, or Up to 4 Players Together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the same fishing spot with friends, chat in real time, and enjoy the catch together. Real VR Fishing is more than a game, it's a place to unwind together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/8ee1ce9ab4ef13bc58a67fda718ee31c.poster.avif?t=1782275649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/8ee1ce9ab4ef13bc58a67fda718ee31c.webm?t=1782275649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/8ee1ce9ab4ef13bc58a67fda718ee31c.mp4?t=1782275649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect, Progress, Customize</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up, release rare fish, and build out your avatar and your own personal aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show your flair by changing up your avatar with our many costume packs. Proudly display your catches in your personal aquarium, and add a touch of beauty with rocks, greenery and trophies from events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/a51cf74926bb2a87519ddd482b675dcb.poster.avif?t=1782275649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/a51cf74926bb2a87519ddd482b675dcb.webm?t=1782275649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/a51cf74926bb2a87519ddd482b675dcb.mp4?t=1782275649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Adventure: Picnic Festa DLC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 7 picnic-themed locations across the US, Spain, and Japan. Rescue Chubby Fish and Starving Sharks, and restore balance to a strangely evolving ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/6e6a88873439f27111f9d58280e78bc8.poster.avif?t=1782275649\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/6e6a88873439f27111f9d58280e78bc8.webm?t=1782275649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1266470/extras/6e6a88873439f27111f9d58280e78bc8.mp4?t=1782275649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always Growing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winner of Oculus Game of the Year 2019. Regular updates and seasonal events keep adding new species and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Download Now and Start Your VR Adventure!</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 or greater / AMD FX 8350 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 980 / AMD R9 390X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Steam VR. Meta Headsets, Valve Index, HTC Vive only<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Meta Quest 2, Meta Quest 3, Oculus Rift S, HTC Vive, Valve Index</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Massively Multiplayer","Simulation","Sports"],"developers":["Devs United Games, Inc"],"publishers":["Devs United Games, Inc."],"release_date":"6 Dec, 2024"}